  "title": "Unlocking Capital While Keeping Railcars in Service",
  "summary": "Greenbrier’s railcar Sale-Leaseback™ solution allows operators to free up capital without sacrificing control of their fleets. Railcars remain in service under flexible short- or long-term leases aligned with business needs. The program combines financing with maintenance, upgrades and fleet optimization to support sustained operational performance.",
